{% if problem.ended and problem.ended.value == 'timed-out' %}the planning turn ran out of time
{%- elif problem.turn_failure %}the planning turn failed ({{ problem.turn_failure.value }})
{%- elif problem.ended %}the planning turn ended without a reply ({{ problem.ended.value }})
{%- else %}the planning turn ended without a reply{% endif %}
{%- endmacro %}
{% macro problem_text(problem, capacity) -%}
{% if problem.kind.value == 'unparseable' -%}
the reply violated the plan schema:
{{ reply_errors(problem.errors) }}
{%- elif problem.kind.value == 'violations' -%}
{% for item in problem.violations %}{{ violation(item) }}{% if not loop.last %}; {% endif %}{% endfor %}
{%- elif problem.kind.value == 'underfilled' -%}
the portfolio schedules {{ problem.scheduled }} of {{ capacity }} free slots, and a free slot idles until a running workstream finishes. Fill every free slot with an independent workstream; return the same portfolio only if no independent work would be useful now
{%- else -%}
{{ ended(problem) }}
{%- endif %}
